  "stem": "The function \\(f\\) is defined by \\(f(x) = \\sqrt{x + 5}\\). For what value of \\(x\\) is \\(f(x) = 4\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "11"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Set \\(\\sqrt{x + 5} = 4\\) and square both sides: \\(x + 5 = 16\\).",
    "So \\(x = 11\\). Check: \\(\\sqrt{11 + 5} = \\sqrt{16} = 4\\)."
  ],
  "explanation": null,
  "traps": null,
